N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_DIAGNOSTIC_CODE, "N00B-C0001", ERROR,
    "the code given to `n00b explain` does not exist",
    "`n00b explain` takes a diagnostic code such as N00B-T0042, with or\n"
    "without the N00B- prefix. Codes appear in diagnostics printed with\n"
    "--terse-diagnostics.")
N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_COMMAND, "N00B-C0002", ERROR,
    "the command line names a command that does not exist",
    "The first word after `n00b` is either a command (build, run, fmt, ...)\n"
    "or a module or file to build. A word that is neither is reported here.\n"
    "Run `n00b help` for the list of commands.")
N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_OPTION, "N00B-C0003", ERROR,
    "the command line uses an option the command does not have",
    "Each command accepts its own options plus the global ones.\n"
    "Run `n00b help <command>` to see them, or `n00b --help-all` for every\n"
    "option including developer ones.")
N00B_DIAG(OPTION_MISSING_VALUE, "N00B-C0004", ERROR,
    "an option that takes a value is given none",
    "Options such as `--output` and `--jobs` need a value, written either as\n"
    "the next word or after `=`:\n"
    "    n00b build --output app main.n\n"
    "    n00b build --jobs=8 main.n")
N00B_DIAG(OPTION_INVALID_NUMBER, "N00B-C0005", ERROR,
    "a numeric option is given a value that is not a number",
    "Options such as `--jobs` and `--keep` take a whole number written in\n"
    "decimal, for example `--jobs 8` or `--keep=2`.")
N00B_DIAG(OPTION_UNEXPECTED_VALUE, "N00B-C0006", ERROR,
    "an on/off option is given a value",
    "Switches such as `--release` or `--lto` are turned on by naming them;\n"
    "they take no value. Write `--release`, not `--release=yes`.")
N00B_DIAG(MISSING_ARGUMENT, "N00B-C0007", ERROR,
    "a command is missing a required argument",
    "Most commands need an input, for example the module or file to build:\n"
    "    n00b build main.n\n"
    "Run `n00b help <command>` to see what a command expects.")
N00B_DIAG(EXTRA_ARGUMENT, "N00B-C0008", ERROR,
    "a command is given more arguments than it takes",
    "`build` and `run` take exactly one module or file. To pass arguments\n"
    "to the program itself, put them after `--`:\n"
    "    n00b run main.n -- --verbose input.txt")
N00B_DIAG(COMMAND_LINE_SYNTAX, "N00B-C0009", ERROR,
    "the command line cannot be understood",
    "A word on the command line does not fit where it appears. Check the\n"
    "order of options and inputs against `n00b help <command>`.")
N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_ACTION, "N00B-C0010", ERROR,
    "a command is given an action or choice it does not have",
    "Some commands take a fixed word as their argument: `toolchain` takes\n"
    "list, use, remove, prune, pin or unpin; `cache` takes clean;\n"
    "`completions` takes bash, zsh, fish or powershell; `help` takes the\n"
    "name of a command.")
N00B_DIAG(INVALID_OPTION_VALUE, "N00B-C0011", ERROR,
    "an option is given a value in the wrong form",
    "The value is present but does not have the shape the option needs.\n"
    "The message names the form expected; `n00b help <command>` describes\n"
    "each option.")
N00B_DIAG(LIBRARY_NEEDS_OUTPUT, "N00B-C0012", ERROR,
    "`n00b library` is run without saying what to write",
    "`library` writes ABI metadata with `--output <file>` or a semantic\n"
    "interface with `--emit-interface <file>`; give one of them:\n"
    "    n00b library --emit-interface mylib.n00bi mylib")
N00B_DIAG(TOOLCHAIN_NOT_FOUND, "N00B-C0020", ERROR,
    "no installed toolchain matches the one requested",
    "A toolchain is named by its id, its version, a unique prefix of its id,\n"
    "or `latest`. `n00b toolchain list` shows what is installed; a checkout\n"
    "installs a new one with `./build.sh install`.")
N00B_DIAG(TOOLCHAIN_AMBIGUOUS, "N00B-C0021", ERROR,
    "the requested toolchain matches more than one installed toolchain",
    "A prefix must pick out exactly one toolchain. Use a longer prefix or the\n"
    "full id shown by `n00b toolchain list`.")
N00B_DIAG(TOOLCHAIN_SELECTION_INVALID, "N00B-C0022", ERROR,
    "a toolchain pin or N00B_TOOLCHAIN names a toolchain that is not installed",
    "A `.n00b-toolchain` file in this directory or a parent, or the\n"
    "N00B_TOOLCHAIN environment variable, picks which installed toolchain\n"
    "runs. Fix it by pinning an installed toolchain (`n00b toolchain pin\n"
    "<id>`), removing the pin (`n00b toolchain unpin` in the directory that\n"
    "holds it), or setting N00B_TOOLCHAIN=latest.")
N00B_DIAG(TOOLCHAIN_START_FAILED, "N00B-C0023", ERROR,
    "the selected toolchain's compiler cannot be started",
    "The toolchain is listed as installed but its `bin/n00b` could not be\n"
    "run. Reinstall it with `./build.sh install`, or remove it with\n"
    "`n00b toolchain remove <id>`.")
N00B_DIAG(TOOLCHAIN_REMOVE_ACTIVE, "N00B-C0024", ERROR,
    "the toolchain to remove is the active one",
    "The active toolchain is the one `n00b` runs by default, so it cannot be\n"
    "removed. Switch to another first with `n00b toolchain use <id>`.")
N00B_DIAG(TOOLCHAIN_CHANGE_FAILED, "N00B-C0025", ERROR,
    "a toolchain operation could not change files on disk",
    "Switching, removing or pinning a toolchain writes to the toolchain store\n"
    "or the current directory. The message names the path and the reason\n"
    "the operating system gave; fix the permissions or free the space.")
N00B_DIAG(TOOLCHAIN_NEEDS_SPEC, "N00B-C0026", ERROR,
    "a toolchain action that needs a toolchain is given none",
    "`toolchain use`, `remove` and `pin` take the toolchain to act on:\n"
    "    n00b toolchain use latest\n"
    "    n00b toolchain pin 0.3.0")
N00B_DIAG(NO_TOOLCHAIN_PIN, "N00B-C0027", ERROR,
    "`n00b toolchain unpin` finds no pin in the current directory",
    "A pin is a `.n00b-toolchain` file. `unpin` removes the one in the\n"
    "current directory only; run it in the directory that holds the pin.")
N00B_DIAG(CACHE_UNAVAILABLE, "N00B-C0030", ERROR,
    "there is no cache directory to use",
    "n00b keeps its cache under N00B_CACHE, XDG_CACHE_HOME or your home\n"
    "directory. None of them is set; set N00B_CACHE to a writable directory.")
N00B_DIAG(CACHE_REMOVE_FAILED, "N00B-C0031", ERROR,
    "part of the cache could not be removed",
    "The message names the path and the reason the operating system gave.\n"
    "Fix the permissions, or remove the directory by hand.")
N00B_DIAG(CACHE_UNUSABLE, "N00B-C0032", WARNING,
    "the cache directory cannot be created or written",
    "Builds still work, but nothing is cached, so every build starts from\n"
    "scratch. Point N00B_CACHE at a writable directory, or unset it to use\n"
    "the default location.")
N00B_DIAG(PACKAGE_PATH_MISSING, "N00B-C0033", WARNING,
    "a package search directory is not a directory",
    "N00B_PATH, `--path` and the `paths.path` setting list extra\n"
    "directories to search for packages. An entry that does not exist is\n"
    "skipped; remove it or fix the path.")
N00B_DIAG(CONTRACT_DIR_MISSING, "N00B-C0034", WARNING,
    "a writ contract directory does not exist",
    "`--contract-dir` and the `paths.contract_dirs` setting add directories\n"
    "of writ contracts for 'ffi literals. A directory that does not exist is\n"
    "skipped; fix the path or drop it.")
N00B_DIAG(PROCESS_START_FAILED, "N00B-C0040", ERROR,
    "`n00b run` cannot start the compiler or the built program",
    "The message names the program and the reason the operating system\n"
    "gave. If the program was built but cannot run, check that the cache\n"
    "directory is not mounted noexec, or set N00B_CACHE elsewhere.")
N00B_DIAG(CONFIG_SYNTAX, "N00B-C0100", ERROR,
    "a configuration file cannot be read as settings",
    "n00b reads settings from ~/.config/n00b/config.cfg and from the\n"
    "nearest n00b.cfg above the current directory. Each file is a list of\n"
    "[section] headers and `name = value` settings; a value is true,\n"
    "false, a whole number, a quoted string, or a list of quoted strings\n"
    "in brackets. `#` starts a comment:\n"
    "    [diagnostics]\n"
    "    color = \"never\"\n"
    "Fix the file at the location shown; `n00b config` shows the result.")
N00B_DIAG(CONFIG_REDEFINED, "N00B-C0101", ERROR,
    "a configuration file sets one setting twice",
    "Each setting may be set once per file. Remove one of the two.")
N00B_DIAG(CONFIG_UNKNOWN_SETTING, "N00B-C0102", WARNING,
    "a configuration file names a setting that does not exist",
    "Every setting belongs to a section such as [build] or [diagnostics].\n"
    "An unknown section or key is ignored. Run `n00b config` to list every\n"
    "setting with its current value.")
N00B_DIAG(CONFIG_WRONG_TYPE, "N00B-C0103", ERROR,
    "a configuration setting has a value of the wrong type",
    "Each setting takes one kind of value: true or false, a whole number,\n"
    "a quoted string, or a list of strings. For example:\n"
    "    [build]\n"
    "    jobs = 8\n"
    "    defines = [\"TRACE=1\"]")
N00B_DIAG(CONFIG_INVALID_VALUE, "N00B-C0104", ERROR,
    "a configuration setting has a value it does not accept",
    "The value has the right type but is outside what the setting allows,\n"
    "such as a worker count above 128 or a color mode other than auto,\n"
    "always or never.")
N00B_DIAG(CONFIG_UNREADABLE, "N00B-C0105", ERROR,
    "a configuration file exists but cannot be read",
    "The message names the file and the reason the operating system gave.\n"
    "Fix its permissions, or move it aside.")
N00B_DIAG(COMPTIME_DISABLED, "N00B-C0106", ERROR,
    "the program needs the comptime phase, but `--no-comptime` turns it off",
    "Some constants or literals in the program are computed by running code\n"
    "at build time. `--no-comptime` skips that run, so the program cannot be\n"
    "built with it. Build without the flag.")
